      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did a test tonight of a world with lots of synced pickups, most of which started disabled. None of the disabled pickups synced properly when enabled. However, when another player picked up the broken synced object, it would force drop the pickup from the other player that was holding it. \nFor the pickups that started enabled, 2 of the 3 synced properly. I'm not certain why the 3rd did not sync but it was fairly complex with multiple triggers and animators on it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
